WEBVTT

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.600
Where am I?

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.560
Pins? Why do I have these?

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.480
Oh, no. It'll turn red!

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:40.900
What was that?

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.810
Scramble Crossing is too crowded.

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.440
Where's Hachiko?

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.850
Eiji Oji was totally cool.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.650
What happened to me?

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.350
Can't they see me?

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:07.480
Whoa!

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:22.310
What's going on?

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:28.190
I'll take it.

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.230
OK.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:31.270
Like it?

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:33.230
Send it to me later.

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:36.940
There are weird walls everywhere I look.

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.520
I can't go anywhere.

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:41.900
I'm completely trapped.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.900
How do I get out of here?

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:49.880
"Reach 104. You have 60 minutes.
Fail, and face erasure.
-The Reapers"

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:48.560
"Reach 104"?

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:51.270
What?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.650
Numbers?

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.400
A person... disappeared?!

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.650
What's going on?!

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:08.520
His hand!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.940
You're also--

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.230
Run!

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.100
Hey! What's going on here?!

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.520
Please.

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:29.810
Huh?

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:32.060
Make a pact with me!

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:34.560
What are you talking about?

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:39.150
If we don't beat the Noise,
we'll be erased too!

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:42.600
Please! Trust me!

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.400
F-Fine.

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.100
I'll do it.

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:53.400
What's this light?

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.940
Our Partner Pact is complete.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.980
Now, we should be able to attack!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.190
See?

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.600
Hey, how'd you do that?

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.350
You can do it too!

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:10.060
Just try letting loose!

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.730
What's that mean?

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.150
I don't...

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.520
...want to disappear!

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:25.730
Yeah! That's the way!

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:30.690
Good thing I was in time!

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.730
Take this!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:49.980
"The World Ends With You
The Animation"

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:56.810
The Reapers' Game

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.190
The walls are disappearing?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.690
Wow!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.230
You're great at using psychs.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:01.690
What're those?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.810
The fire you just used is one.

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:09.560
We'll have to keep fighting Noise, so I
might be lucky I got you as my partner.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:15.020
I'm Shiki Misaki. Call me Shiki.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.940
Your hand...

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:22.980
A countdown to our mission's deadline.
Just like yours.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:27.270
But it should go away
if we clear the mission.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:30.850
Umm, what's your name?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.310
I'm... Neku.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.100
First or last name?

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.100
OK...

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:43.520
You need a partner with you to use psychs.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:46.730
So, let's team up.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.560
We'll clear this mission
if we make it to 104.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:56.150
Why do we have to bother with that?

00:05:56.150 --> 00:06:00.810
You saw someone get attacked
by Noise and disappear, right?

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:06.060
We're Players in the Reapers' Game.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:09.810
We have to survive seven days,
or we'll be erased.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:19.350
Partner Pact between Neku Sakuraba
and Shiki Misaki confirmed.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.060
Man, what a pain.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:24.730
Take this seriously!
This is why you never get promoted!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:25.900
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:29.560
You got right to hunting Players
on the first day, huh, Uzuki.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:34.350
Of course I did. I'm going to get ahead,
unlike someone I know.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:38.480
Still, I expected a bit better results.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:41.480
That kid might not be a pushover.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:46.650
Was someone just watching me?

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.600
We're at 104!

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.770
Nothing happened on the way here.

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.520
Think this counts?

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.310
The timer's gone.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.980
Oh, thank goodness!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.190
Who's there?!

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:06.350
I honestly didn't think much of you,
but you're pretty sharp.

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:09.020
Black wings...

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.650
Are you... Reapers?

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:12.810
That's right.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:16.520
The more Players a Reaper erases,
the higher they rise in the ranks.

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:19.440
Huh? What's that mean?!

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:23.350
Do your best and entertain us.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:28.520
What's going on?

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:35.270
Am I... going to be erased like this?

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.980
I... I...

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.810
Where...?

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.810
Oh! You're awake?

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:47.480
What?!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.480
Whoa!

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.690
You startled me, too.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:52.730
Where...?

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:56.560
Scramble Crossing, same as yesterday.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:59.100
It must be day two of the Reapers' Game.

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:04.980
I wonder how far those walls go.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:07.940
Hey, you.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:09.100
Shiki.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:15.980
Tell me everything you
know about this world.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:19.270
Didn't they tell you when
you joined the game?

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:22.940
No. When I came to,
I was lying over there.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.520
What?

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.900
This place is Shibuya,
but it's not Shibuya.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.940
It's like a parallel world.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.650
It's called the Underground.

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:40.020
It's like... it's the same place,
but only we are in a different world.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:42.560
Those people are in the Realground.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.980
They can't see or hear us.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.730
But instead...

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:49.350
Try touching one.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:54.690
I can't wait for 777's concert.

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:55.850
Hear it?

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.980
That's called "scanning."

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.060
Scanning?

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.940
Yeah.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.940
We can't talk to people in the Realground,

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:07.980
but we get the power to read their minds.

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:11.600
I don't want to deal with people.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:15.440
Knowing what they think without
having to talk is fine by me.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:16.650
Yo!

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.940
Hands off, you damn Reaper!

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:24.100
Hey, Beat!

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.730
R-Reaper?

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:26.810
Who's this guy?

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:30.690
Don't play dumb! You're one of them!

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:31.650
"Them"?

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:32.600
Yeah!

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:36.600
I couldn't scan you, so you've
gotta be a Reaper!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.060
Hey, stop it!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.060
Stop, Beat!

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.310
Stay out of this, Rhyme!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:43.690
They're Players just like us!

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.350
What?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.060
Look, Player pins!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.770
Players can't read each other's minds!

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.650
You can't scan me either, right, Beat?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.230
It's the same thing.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:00.900
I'm Beat.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.150
And this is my partner, Rhyme.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:04.440
Nice to meet you.

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:05.400
Sorry.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:08.270
A pink-haired chick set
us up yesterday, and...

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.900
We know her!

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.400
For real?! You too, huh?

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:15.690
But thanks to Neku, we managed
to clear the mission.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.350
Oh, so you're tough, huh?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.480
Does he ever take his headphones off?

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:27.400
Don't let it bother you!
I'm sure he's confused.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.980
Oh, our mission.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:35.350
"Set the cursed sculpture free.
Fail, and face erasure," huh?

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:43.270
There they are.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:44.690
Hey, Neku!

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:46.190
Hey!

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:53.270
Wait, Neku!

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:56.600
Neku!

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.770
Don't run off on your own!

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.520
We should fight them together!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.310
Shut up!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:16.270
I don't want strangers I just met
telling me what to do!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:22.310
Maybe I should send out some better Noise.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:23.690
Don't overdo it.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.150
This is nothing!

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:28.350
Angry Boy will self-destruct on his own.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:31.520
Negative emotions attract Noise.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:36.440
A human who gets possessed by noise
and turns negative might do anything.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:37.850
Damn!

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.850
What an annoying sound.

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:40.900
Why...?

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.350
Why am I...

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:45.230
...so angry?!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.850
Whoa.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.810
We cleared it already?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.270
Neku! You OK?!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:57.230
Oh, how dull.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:00.100
You're that Reaper from yesterday!

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.650
Are you sending us these missions?

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:06.480
So what if I am, Neku Sakuraba?

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:08.730
Neku... Sakuraba?

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:10.600
That's my name?

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:14.150
Neku Sakuraba, I want to offer you a deal.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.310
Huh?

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:19.940
If you kill that girl, Shiki Misaki,

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.480
I'll release you from this game.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.560
Huh? The hell did you say?!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:28.190
Yo! Don't let a Reaper
tell you what to do!

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:30.560
If you can't clear it,

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:33.770
you'll face erasure.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.850
No, Neku! Don't listen to her!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.060
I...

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:41.400
I will...

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.060
Neku...

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.020
Neku...!

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:53.940
Please... don't kill me.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:57.400
Ne...

00:12:58.730 --> 00:12:59.940
Neku.

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:01.810
I will...

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:07.190
That's right. Just follow your heart.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:09.150
That's enough of that.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:12.480
Stop.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:13.690
What?

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.520
Are you OK?!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:18.190
I'm fine.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.600
What did I...?

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.850
Hey! How dumb can you be?!

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.900
Resist negative emotions.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.730
They consume you when Noise possesses you.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:32.850
You stay out of this.
It was just getting good.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:35.810
You've got to follow the rules, lady.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.980
What? Where did this come from?

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.190
Who are you, anyway?

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:42.350
The rules are one mission per day,

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:45.980
and only the Game Master can send them.

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:51.350
And even the Game Master can only
directly attack Players on day seven.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.600
You're well informed.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.600
The Game Master is way
stronger than any noise.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:01.480
To survive all seven days,
you'll need to work together.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:07.520
Only those who can trust
their partners can survive.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:11.400
Who trust their partners...

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:18.940
Another day's gone by?

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.060
She's...

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:24.980
...not here.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:26.440
Of course not.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:30.520
Not... after what I did.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.480
Whoa!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.100
Oh, sorry.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.690
Your surprise startled me again.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.900
I panicked because you weren't nearby.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.600
I figured you'd be in
the same place, but...

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.850
Sorry.

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.560
What I did to you was awful.

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.440
Huh?! I-It's fine!

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:56.940
Um, I mean, I guess you couldn't
help it in that situation, or--

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.650
U-Umm...

00:14:58.650 --> 00:14:59.980
Let's talk more!

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:02.600
I said we should team up,

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:06.560
but I didn't tell you anything about me.

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:09.980
You can't trust a total stranger, right?

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:10.800
That's not it.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:11.440
Huh?

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:14.730
I... don't know about myself.

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:19.270
The name "Neku" is pretty
much all I remember.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.310
Until that Reaper said so yesterday,

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.100
I didn't know I was Neku Sakuraba.

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:30.100
You mean... you have amnesia?

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.770
I see.

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:34.850
A mission?

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:38.770
"Defeat the master of O-East"?

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:41.730
Oh, O-East is a concert hall.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:45.600
I think... it's over that way.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.510
Dogenzaka

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:48.810
I've been a bunch of times.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:51.350
The most popular band
right now is Death March.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.690
My friends like them and--

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.060
Man, what a drag.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.150
He yells at me every single day.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:16:00.060
I hope the concert gets canceled!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.650
Noise...

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:04.100
He's like you were yesterday, Neku.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.060
Sorry.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.850
Huh?! That's not what I--!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:11.230
OK, then let's beat that Noise first!

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:13.520
Wait. That's not our mission.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:16.230
Yeah, but I can't ignore him.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.310
Guess we've got no choice.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:24.520
Yup.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.810
Wow! We were on fire just now!

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:55.940
Like we synced up or something.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:57.020
Really?

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:00.980
Excuse me, was I, like,
possessed by Noise just now?

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.270
Yup. A pretty big one.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.020
Ugh! I'm way too weak.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.690
Thanks for saving me.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:09.810
You're welcome.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.850
Hey, you satisfied now?

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:13.600
We've got to hurry to O-East.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:16.400
Oh, what a coincidence.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:17.940
Let's go together.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:24.060
Hey there...

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.690
You're late!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.270
I'm sorry!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:32.480
777! Death March's vocalist!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.690
Oh, you know us?

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:35.690
Yes!

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:37.440
Glad to hear it.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:40.520
Oh, these guys saved my life.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.520
I kind of messed up with some Noise.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:45.770
What? You're hopeless.

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:49.150
In that case, I've got to thank you.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:52.440
Take this. It's special concert merch.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:53.600
You mean it?!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.900
Yeah.

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:57.900
How valuable it ends up
being depends on you.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.940
You can go in.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:03.520
Thank you so much!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.940
You seem pretty happy.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:12.190
Of course! We got to help someone,
meet 777, and go inside!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.190
Three birds with one stone!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:21.560
Make sure you listen till the end.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.350
There should be a "master" in here.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.650
We're short on time.

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:36.520
Noise!

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:37.940
Hey, Neku!

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.400
Damn it! There's too many!

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:48.600
Neku!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.440
At this rate...

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.350
Neku!

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:01.560
Don't try to fight alone!

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:04.230
We're partners--

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.440
Behind you!

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.940
Is that the master?

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:20.840
Huh?

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.980
Looks like you're having a hard time.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.440
Let's make this flashy!

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:31.350
With four of us, we're stronger than ever!

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:33.020
Beat! Rhyme!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:37.900
Dodge!

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:43.100
Yo! We'll draw off the small fry!

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.520
Take out the big one while we do!

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:48.330
Hey!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.600
What?!

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:55.270
Can we do another move like that one time?

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:59.690
We can if you trust me!

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.310
I'll try.

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.730
OK!

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.270
Well then, let's go!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.480
Yeah.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:35.350
Neku!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:38.810
Let's go!

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:40.020
Yeah!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.850
Go!

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.310
We cleared it?

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:15.600
Neku!

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:16.940
Are you OK?!

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:18.150
Yeah.

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:23.520
Thanks, Neku.

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:29.770
I can stand up on my own.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.230
Huh?

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:32.900
But...

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:35.150
...thanks for earlier.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.230
You're welcome.

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:44.690
Hey, are you OK?

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.150
Yup! We're fine!

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:50.150
Thank you so much.

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:53.190
This stuff is give-and-take.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.900
Hey, I've got an idea!

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:59.060
Starting tomorrow,
let's do our missions together.

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:00.770
Oh! Count me in!

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:03.980
If Rhyme's down, then so am I,

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:06.020
but what about Phones there?

00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:10.650
He couldn't help it before.
The Noise was affecting him.

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:14.730
Plus, Neku doesn't remember
anything before he got here.

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:18.600
He doesn't?

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:21.400
That weird guy told us, remember?

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:25.350
To survive all seven days,
we'll have to work together.

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:33.810
Over half the Players in this Reapers'
Game have already been erased.

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:36.600
It's entered the final stage.

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:37.560
Yeah.

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:40.310
Let's kill 'em all and get it over with.

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:41.600
Minamimoto.

00:22:41.600 --> 00:22:45.060
You're 9 minutes and 42 seconds late.

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:47.900
And you're as annoying as ever, Konishi.

00:22:47.900 --> 00:22:49.150
Hm?

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:52.190
I see an unfamiliar beast.

00:22:52.190 --> 00:22:55.230
Stop. You're being rude.

00:22:55.230 --> 00:22:59.190
He's the current Game Master, Higashizawa.

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.020
I shall meet your expectations

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:04.650
and prepare the ultimate
feast for you, Mr. Kitaniji.

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:06.150
Suck-up.

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:09.770
Don't underestimate Higashizawa.
He's a capable worker.

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:13.900
Above all, he's far more
cooperative than you, Minamimoto.

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:16.520
"Cooperative"!

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:21.150
I've gotten the Composer's permission
to promote you, Higashizawa.

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:24.060
I am grateful and delighted.

00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:26.650
But there is one condition.

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:32.020
Erase ever single Player.

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:35.480
He was so cool!

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:38.400
"I'm gonna start a revolution
in the music world!"

00:23:38.400 --> 00:23:39.690
How's that?

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:41.400
Oh!

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:46.520
Speaking of which, how come
777 was able to see us?

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:49.020
Isn't it obvious?

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.020
Those guys...

00:23:54.730 --> 00:23:56.480
...are Reapers.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:02.000
SHIKI

00:23:59.440 --> 00:24:01.810
Next time: "Shiki."
